<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mth BUBOR rate up, 3-mth, 6-mth flat.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mth BUBOR rate up, 3-mth, 6-mth flat.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) rose on percentage point on Thursday while the three and six-month rates were unchanged, the National Bank of Hungary said on its  BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.80 percent, the three-month rate at 20.73 percent, while the six-month rate was set at 20.55 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
